_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 7
---
order: 7
---
short_label: VIII.7
---
statement: If there are as many numbers as we please in continued proportion, and the first measures the last, then it also measures the second.
---
proof:

Let there are as many numbers as we please, *A, B, C,* and *D,* in continued proportion, and let *A* measure *D.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="270" height="170" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="VIII.7 diagram" src="propVIII7.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
        canvasid: "canvas_0",
        background: "35,19,100",
        title: "VIII.7",
        elements: [
            "A0;point;free;-1000,40;0;0",
            "A3;point;free;1000,40;0;0",
            "B0;point;free;-1000,75;0;0",
            "B3;point;free;1000,75;0;0",
            "C0;point;free;-1000,110;0;0",
            "C3;point;free;1000,110;0;0",
            "D0;point;free;-1000,145;0;0",
            "D3;point;free;1000,145;0;0",
            "A1;point;lineSlider;A0,A3,30,0;0",
            "A2;point;lineSlider;A0,A3,90,0;0",
            "A;line;connect;A1,A2;black",
            "B1;point;lineSlider;B0,B3,30,0;0",
            "B2;point;lineSlider;B0,B3,120,0;0",
            "B;line;connect;B1,B2;black",
            "C1;point;lineSlider;C0,C3,30,0;0",
            "C2;point;proportion;A1,A2,B1,B2,B1,B2,C1,C3;0",
            "C;line;connect;C1,C2;black",
            "D1;point;lineSlider;D0,D3,30,0;0",
            "D2;point;proportion;A1,A2,B1,B2,C1,C2,D1,D3;0",
            "D;line;connect;D1,D2;black"
        ],
    });
</script>
</figure>

I say that *A* also measures *B.*

If *A* does not measure *B,* neither does any other of the numbers measure any other. But *A* measures *D.* Therefore *A* also measures *B.* [!just VIII.6]

Therefore, *if there are as many numbers as we please in continued proportion, and the first measures the last, then it also measures the second.*

<div class="qed">Q.E.D.</div>
<br clear="all">
---
body:

This proposition is the contrapositive of the previous theorem.

#### Use of this theorem

This proposition is used in propositions @VIII.14 and @VIII.15.
